{"title":"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 9","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The grading scale shown is used at Jones Junior High.  The fifteen scores in Mr. Freeman's class were: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/9/d89893f848ae5850ac8c198d06278269b17d3489.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\begin{tabular}[t]{lllllllll} 89, &amp; 72, &amp; 54, &amp; 97, &amp; 77, &amp; 92, &amp; 85, &amp; 74, &amp; 75, \\\\ 63, &amp; 84, &amp; 78, &amp; 71, &amp; 80, &amp; 90. &amp; &amp; &amp; \\\\ \\end{tabular}\\]\" width=\"349\" height=\"34\" />\n</p><p>In Mr. Freeman's class, what percent of the students received a grade of C?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/f/67f2dc5e3c44e79d79243fe5e8b62b3ca804f22f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\boxed{\\begin{tabular}[t]{cc} A: &amp; 93 - 100 \\\\ B: &amp; 85 - 92 \\\\ C: &amp; 75 - 84 \\\\ D: &amp; 70 - 74 \\\\ F: &amp; 0 - 69  \\end{tabular}}\\]\" width=\"127\" height=\"111\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/6/586108a0952b942633be264245cc1f842c639a31.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 20\\% \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 25\\% \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 30\\% \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 33\\frac{1}{3}\\% \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 40\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"464\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Of the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/9/f1965fae079a9ba2c0726c307070c2355dfcb213.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> students in Mr. Freeman's class, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> students (those with scores of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/f/7af4b3f8897671e2879b10badf471e5deec8952e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$77$\" width=\"18\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/e/a7e4c2930d79c57bee209557767b878cd704ea46.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$75$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/3/4131457f67c5dbfd8b1c6be1f74a47595a9bd3be.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$84$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"18\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/d/76d15d808807bfa561e72dc8111649ed0a204ebe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$78$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/a/fea5fcc6d66685ee21f722efcd228eb44d38f262.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$80$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />) received a grade of C.  So <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/c/a6c1826a6cc74cffcb1eac911d5ac553f1d629b9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{5}{15}=\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\ 33\\frac{1}{3}\\%}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"141\" height=\"49\" /> of his students received a grade of C.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsectio